vive  long enough or well enough  to begin any new projects for itself but  if it does  if humanity is to hold on if it is to  make use of its second chance  of its continuation it must attempt to  first free itself of all its delusions  it must from the very foundation  understand the total implications of its  conflicting  contradictory and poorly serving  relationship with itself  its consciousness and the world a new  philosophy must hold and comfort us  outside the whirlpool of our  consciousness and not push us any  further under  it mustn't pose nor seek answers mustn't  provide resolutions  nor desire for improvement mustn't  declare doctrines for how to live  no rationales for why but rather aid and  comfort us all  in the potential and likely  impossibility of successfully achieving  any of the above a philosophy that finds  resolution  reconciliation and eternalness in the  absence  of needing any a philosophy that  somehow consoles us  thank you so much for watching for  anyone interested the audiobook version  of my debut book  notes from the end of everything is now  available you can find the links to it  in the description below  on all platforms it is voiced by myself  if you have or do purchase a copy of the  audiobook or any other version  thank you sincerely the support and  positive feedback on the book in general  have been overwhelming and it is deeply  appreciated  and of course thank you so much for  watching in general  and see you next video  [Music]  you

